5.  Cross browser testing


Limitation of cypress?
1. cannot automation desktop based application
2. Limited supports 
3. Supports availble only for javascripts and type script
4. reading and writing data from external files is difficult
5. Third party support is not available. 


Commands to install and open cypress
1. npm install cypress 
2. npx cypress open - to run testscript from cypress UI


how to run the test from terminal or CMD
1. npx cypress run -- runs tests from cypress...
	bydefault - cypress runs the testscript on elctron browser with headless mode.
2. npx cypress run --headed | this execute scripts on browser without headless mode on.
3. npx cypress run --headed --browser "browsername"
